sequenceDiagram
  title: Checkout Sequence
  autonumber

  box Frontend
    participant U as User
    participant W as Web App
  end
  participant API@{ "type": "boundary", "alias": "Orders API" }
  participant DB@{ "type": "database" }
  participant PSP as Payment Provider

  U->>+W: click checkout
  W->>+API: POST /orders
  API->>DB: insert order (pending)

  alt card accepted
    API->>+PSP: authorize
    PSP-->>-API: approved
    API->>DB: mark paid
    API-->>W: 201 Created
  else declined
    API->>DB: mark failed
    API--xW: 402 Payment Required
  end

  Note over U,W: result is rendered inline
  W-->>-U: confirmation
  deactivate API
